				<ProtectedString name="Source">--Version 2 1.01 Beta     Sorry it took me so long to release this script, i kept on putting off releasing it as i felt i needed to think of more commands to add, but i cant think of anything else at the moment so i figured i might as well finally release it now.
adminlist = {&quot;Mustangman6666&quot;,&quot;MeNotAnyBody&quot;,&quot;mariostarjr4&quot;,&quot;Sylux7&quot;,&quot;ario94&quot;, &quot;Lego&quot;, &quot;TeslaTrooper&quot;}--Add in the names of the people you want to be able to use the command script here.
--Please keep my name in there. ;)
