fix
If the command script breaks for you, say this to fix it

kill/Mustangman6666
kills Mustangman6666

loopkill/Mustangman6666
Repeatedly kills Mustangman6666 when he respawns

unloopkill/Mustangman6666
Undos loopkill/

heal/Mustangman6666
Returns Mustangman6666 to full health

damage/Mustangman6666/50
Makes Mustangman6666&apos;s character take 50 damage

health/Mustangman6666/999999
Makes Mustangman6666&apos;s MaxHealth and Health 999999

