Removes Mustangman6666 from the game, cannot be used by admin/ed people

ban/Mustangman6666
Removes Mustangman6666 from the game and keeps him from reenterring, cannot be used by admin/ed people

bannedlist
Shows a list of everyone banned

unban/Mustangman6666
Unbans Mustangman6666

explode/Mustangman6666
Explodes Mustangman6666&apos;s character

rocket/Mustangman6666
Straps a rocket onto Mustangman6666&apos;s back

