Removes all of Mustangman6666&apos;s tools.

givetools/Mustangman6666
Gives Mustangman6666 all the tools in StarterPack

givebtools/Mustangman6666
Gives Mustangman6666 the building tools

sit/Mustangman6666
Makes Mustangman6666 sit

jump/Mustangman6666
Makes Mustangman6666 jump

stand/Mustangman6666
Makes Mustangman6666 stand

part/4/1/2
