unjail/Mustangman6666
Undos jail/

punish/Mustangman6666
Puts Mustangman6666&apos;s character in game.Lighting

unpunish/Mustangman6666
Undos punish/

merge/Mustangman6666/Farvei
Makes Mustangman6666 control Farvei&apos;s character

teleport/Mustangman6666/nccvoyager
Teleports Mustangman6666&apos;s character to nccvoyager&apos;s character

control/Mustangman6666
Makes you control Mustangman6666&apos;s character

change/Mustangman6666/Money/999999
Makes the Money value in Mustangman6666&apos;s leaderstats 999999

tools
Gives you a list of all the tools available to be give/en, the tool must be in game.Lighting

give/Mustangman6666/Tool
Give&apos;s Mustangman6666 a tool, the toolname can be abbreviated

time/15.30
Makes game.Lighting.TimeOfDay 15:30

ambient/255/0/0
Makes game.Lighting.Ambient 255,0,0

maxplayers/20
Makes game.Players.MaxPlayers 20

nograv/Mustangman6666
Makes Mustangman6666 almost weightless

antigrav/Mustangman6666
Gives Mustangman6666 antigravity properties

grav/Mustangman6666
Returns Mustangman6666&apos;s gravity to normal

highgrav/Mustangman6666
Makes Mustangman6666 heavier

setgrav/Mustangman6666/-196
Sets Mustangman6666&apos;s gravity

trip/Mustangman6666
Makes Mustangman6666&apos;s character trip

walkspeed/Mustangman6666/99
Makes Mustangman6666&apos;s character&apos;s humanoid&apos;s WalkSpeed 99, 16 is average

invisible/Mustangman6666
Makes Mustangman6666&apos;s character invisible

visible/Mustangman6666
Undos invisible/

freeze/Mustangman6666
Makes Mustangman6666&apos;s character unable to move

thaw/Mustangman6666
Undos freeze/

unlock/Mustangman6666
Makes Mustangman6666&apos;s character unlocked

lock/Mustangman6666
Makes Mustangman6666&apos;s character locked

ff/Mustangman6666
Gives Mustangman6666&apos;s character a ForceField

unff/Mustangman6666
Undos ff/

sparkles/Mustangman6666
Makes Person299&apos;s character sparkly

unsparkles/Mustangman6666
Undos sparkles/

shield/Mustangman6666
Makes a destructive shield thingy appear around Person299

unshield/Mustangman6666
